# Heavy / max-diversity fleet — author's full seven.
# Use when quota allows or for high-stakes reviews:
#   bash launch.sh ... --fleet-file "$SKILL_DIR/fleet.full"
#
# Daily default is fleet.defaults (usual six). Same line format.
# Add-back remaining diversity on top of the six:
#   mimopro
# Daily Go seat is none (hy3 and Go glm53 dropped: OpenCode Go quota exhausted).
# Heavy Go seat is mimopro only.
# No OpenRouter seat (oxalpha dropped: stealth/ox-alpha unusable).
# No Antigravity seat (g37flash dropped). Cursor Gemini seat is g38flash.
# SiliconFlow daily seats: dsv4flash (V4-Flash-0731) + glm53 (GLM-5.3 max).
# oxalpha, hy3, glm52, k27code, dsv4pro, dsflash, dots3, and g37flash are out of both fleets.
# gpt6astra is official Codex CLI gpt-6-astra:medium (cursor gpt-5.6-sol dropped).
# Kimi K3 is cursor-cli only (k3max); opencode-go k3 is out of both fleets.
# qwen38max is out unless explicitly --agent'd.

gpt6astra=codex:gpt-6-astra:medium
mimopro=opencode-go/mimo-v2.5-pro:max
dsv4flash=siliconflow/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash:max
glm53=siliconflow/zai-org/GLM-5.3:max
fable51=cursor:claude-fable-5-1-thinking-high
k3max=cursor:kimi-k3-max
g38flash=cursor:gemini-3.8-flash-high
